  "description": "How Bulkhead sees AgentDojo's simulated tools: effect class, output trust, and sinks per tool, plus a static per-suite task policy. Output trust is declared from AgentDojo's field layout (where its injection vectors are placed) and checked with canaries by bulkhead.eval.agentdojo.trust_check: a tool is trusted only if its output holds no third-party text (numbers, the user's own account data, the model's own confirmation). Every tool with an external_effect sink is taint-sensitive in the policy_taint configuration.",
